    <description>
        <p>Gamepad Media Center Aggregator (GMCA) is a native, controller-first client that brings your media servers to the devices their official apps ignore — Nintendo Switch, PS Vita and Linux / Raspberry Pi on a TV.</p>
        <p>One identical interface for every backend:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Connect to Plex, Jellyfin, Emby or Stremio</li>
            <li>Movies, shows, seasons and episodes with a 10-foot, gamepad-first UI</li>
            <li>Based on the MPV player (direct play and transcoding)</li>
            <li>Search, genres, collections and person pages; offline downloads</li>
        </ul>
    </description>
